{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/627","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/627/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/627/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/627/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/627","id":121204646,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMjEyMDQ2NDY=","number":627,"title":"abstract-class-instantiated false positive with regard to instantiations in classmethods","user":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":297274515,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTcyNzQ1MTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/labels/Bug%20:beetle:","name":"Bug :beetle:","color":"ea9896","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2015-08-25T20:27:27Z","updated_at":"2015-12-09T10:18:38Z","closed_at":"2015-12-09T10:18:38Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Originally reported by: **Claudiu Popa (BitBucket: [PCManticore](http://bitbucket.org/PCManticore), GitHub: @PCManticore)**\n\n---\n\nWhen an abstract method is instantiated inside a method of the said class, then we should try not to emit the error, since we don't know the context of the method is manipulated from outside. We should warn only when the class is instantiated outside of its domain. Currently, we're not doing that for normal methods, but for classmethods we have a false positive.\n\n```\n#!python\n\nimport abc, six\n\n@six.add_metaclass(abc.ABCMeta)\nclass A(object):\n    @abc.abstractmethod\n    def test(self):\n        f = self()\n        print(f)\n\n    @classmethod\n    def test(cls):\n        c = cls()\n        print(c)\n\n```\n\n---\n- Bitbucket: https://bitbucket.org/logilab/pylint/issue/627\n","closed_by":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"p